n"},"widgets_values":["### ✍️ Prompt Building\n\nKlein cannot carry Krea-2 LoRAs: the look comes from the SOURCE IMAGE. The edit prompt names ONLY the element that changes and states that everything else stays identical (style, palette, linework, lighting, pose, composition, backdrop). An edited approved sheet is a NEW artifact — re-approve it."],"title":"✍️ Prompt Building","color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":22,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[975,-263],"size":[300,223],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{"draftsman":"comfy-draftsman"},"widgets_values":["### 🧠 Models\n\nflux-2-klein-base-9b-fp8 is the only Klein on the instance (the registry's 'distilled' file is not installed). Qwen3 8B fp8 encoder (type=flux2), full_encoder_small_decoder VAE."],"title":"🧠 Models","color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":23,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[1315,-178],"size":[380,138],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{"draftsman":"comfy-draftsman"},"widgets_values":["### 🔌 Conditioning\n\nSource is VAE-encoded once and set as the reference latent on BOTH the positive and the zeroed negative (the official Klein edit template pattern)."],"title":"🔌 Conditioning","color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":24,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[2395,-382],"size":[380,342],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{"draftsman":"comfy-draftsman"},"widgets_values":["### 🎛️ Sampling\n\n4 steps, CFG 1.0, euler, Flux2Scheduler — the settings the proven Lan edit ran with on this model. Seed fixed; render.py sets it from the job row."],"title":"🎛️ Sampling","color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":25,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[4210,-161],"size":[300,121],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{"draftsman":"comfy-draftsman"},"widgets_values":["### Size\n\nGetImageSize on SOURCE → latent + scheduler width/height."],"title":"Size","color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":26,"type":"MarkdownNote